    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114917" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσο-μίτρης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου,</span>
		
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσο-μίτρας</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with girdle</i> or <i>headband
				of gold,</i> epith. of Dionysus, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				209
			</span></i> (lyr.); pecul. fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μίτρη,</span>
			of Phoebe, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>gold-bound,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίνακες</span> Hippoloch. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				4.130b
			</span></i>.</div>
